{
  "_comment": "transfer_s2 STAGE 2, ARM M: identical to transfer_s1 sweep_M.json except the learning rate, which is lr*(512) = 0.0005, selected by the stage-1 rule fixed in PREREGISTRATION.md (RESULTS_STAGE1.md). Six lanes, twelve seeds, 3600 steps, checkpoint every 200 for the prune relay. Created 12 Sep 2026 after the licence anchor (commit 90791ed); no stage-2 run existed before it.",
